msgid "ReliefMath 数学渲染"
msgstr "ReliefMath Mathematical Rendering"

msgid "本文件记录实现选择与实际证据；目标 GUI 及虚拟机运行仍待验收。"
msgstr ""
"This document records implementation choices and actual evidence; target GUI"
" and VM runtime acceptance are still pending."

msgid "选择依据"
msgstr "Selection Rationale"

msgid ""
"已确认规格将 MicroTeX 固定候选设为 "
"``0e3707f6dafebb121d98b53c64364d16fefe481d``。实际下载该提交并隔离检查，默认主机 CMake 因缺少 "
"``gtksourceviewmm-3.0`` 失败；其 GNU 构建采用 C++20，并依赖标准 C++ 库、异常、filesystem 和 GTK "
"C++ 图形实现。使用本项目现行 C++17、``-nostdinc++ -fno-exceptions -fno-rtti`` 标志交叉编译 "
"``src/core/core.cpp``，实际在 ``cstring`` 头处失败。证据保留于 ``out/tmp/reliefmath-"
"backend/cmake-host.log`` 和 ``microtex-"
"target.log``。这不是声称上游不能移植，而是本版本没有为公式工具引入完整 GTK/C++ 开发栈。"
msgstr ""
"The confirmed specification pinned the MicroTeX candidate to "
"``0e3707f6dafebb121d98b53c64364d16fefe481d``. That commit was downloaded and"
" inspected in isolation. Default host CMake failed because "
"``gtksourceviewmm-3.0`` was missing. Its GNU build uses C++20 and depends on"
" the standard C++ library, exceptions, filesystem, and GTK C++ graphics. "
"Cross-compiling ``src/core/core.cpp`` with this project's current C++17 and "
"``-nostdinc++ -fno-exceptions -fno-rtti`` flags failed at the ``cstring`` "
"header. Evidence remains in ``out/tmp/reliefmath-backend/cmake-host.log`` "
"and ``microtex-target.log``. This does not claim upstream cannot be ported; "
"this version simply does not introduce a full GTK/C++ development stack for "
"the formula tool."

msgid ""
"因此采用规格允许的本地受限递归下降解析器、数学盒模型和扁平字形显示列表，使用 FreeType 与 Cairo 的 C 接口。GUI "
"不链接数学后端；独立 ``reliefmath-render.elf`` 只接受有界源码协议，不运行 shell、网络请求或 TeX 命令。支持范围见 "
"兼容清单。"
msgstr ""
"The implementation therefore uses the specification-permitted local bounded "
"recursive-descent parser, mathematical box model, and flat glyph display "
"list, through FreeType and Cairo C interfaces. The GUI does not link the "
"math backend. A separate ``reliefmath-render.elf`` accepts only a bounded "
"source protocol and runs no shells, network requests, or TeX commands. See "
"the compatibility list for supported scope."

msgid "字体与依赖"
msgstr "Fonts and Dependencies"

msgid ""
"数学字体为 STIX Two Math，来源 ``stipub/stixfonts`` 的 ``v2.13b171``，原文件路径 "
"``fonts/static_otf/STIXTwoMath-Regular.otf``。仓库字体 SHA256 为 "
"``3a5f3f26f40d5698b3c62dd085d48d6663696a3f80825aab8b553d5097518e8c``，完整 SIL "
"OFL 随资源保留。字形缺失时回退到系统现有 SimSun；中文也通过 FreeType 提取轮廓。两者仍无字形则明确报错，不生成缺字符号冒充成功。"
msgstr ""
"The math font is STIX Two Math from ``stipub/stixfonts`` ``v2.13b171``, "
"originally at ``fonts/static_otf/STIXTwoMath-Regular.otf``. The repository "
"font SHA256 is "
"``3a5f3f26f40d5698b3c62dd085d48d6663696a3f80825aab8b553d5097518e8c``, and "
"the complete SIL OFL is retained with the resources. Missing glyphs fall "
"back to the system's existing SimSun; Chinese outlines are also extracted "
"through FreeType. If neither font has a glyph, rendering explicitly fails "
"rather than substituting a missing-character symbol and claiming success."

msgid ""
"只使用 STIX 字体，不分发 MicroTeX 的代码或资源。目标路径为 ``/usr/share/reliefmath/STIXTwoMath-"
"Regular.otf``，中文使用 ``/usr/share/fonts/reliefos/simsun.ttc``；许可证装入 "
"``/usr/share/licenses/reliefmath/``。"
msgstr ""
"Only STIX fonts are used; MicroTeX code and resources are not distributed. "
"The target path is ``/usr/share/reliefmath/STIXTwoMath-Regular.otf``; "
"Chinese uses ``/usr/share/fonts/reliefos/simsun.ttc``. Licenses are "
"installed under ``/usr/share/licenses/reliefmath/``."

msgid ""
"Cairo ``1.18.4-r1`` 与 FreeType ``2.14.3-r0`` 的开发 APK 使用 "
"``configs/dependencies.lock.json`` 固定 URL 与 SHA256，通过显式 ``make fetch`` "
"获取。构建脚本使用系统信任密钥验证 APK 签名并校验摘要，再以临时完整树发布到专有开发目录；不覆盖共享 X11 开发树。运行时使用系统已有的相同版本 "
"APK。没有改变全局 C++ 编译标志。"
msgstr ""
"Development APK URLs and SHA256 values for Cairo ``1.18.4-r1`` and FreeType "
"``2.14.3-r0`` are pinned in ``configs/dependencies.lock.json`` and fetched "
"explicitly with ``make fetch``. Build scripts verify APK signatures with "
"system trusted keys and check digests, then publish a complete temporary "
"tree to a dedicated development directory without overwriting the shared X11"
" development tree. Runtime uses existing system APKs of the same versions. "
"Global C++ compilation flags are unchanged."

msgid "渲染与输出"
msgstr "Rendering and Output"

msgid ""
"公式布局生成字形、伸缩和横线的同一条路径。SVG 只写出 "
"``svg/g/path``，所有字形（包含中文）都是真实曲线；没有位图、``text``、脚本或外部链接。PNG 由同一条 Cairo "
"路径填充到透明图层，预览由其直通 RGBA 数据生成。SVG 与 PNG 尺寸、边距和基线相同。"
msgstr ""
"Formula layout generates one shared path for glyphs, stretching, and rules. "
"SVG writes only ``svg/g/path``; all glyphs, including Chinese, are actual "
"curves, with no bitmaps, ``text``, scripts, or external links. PNG fills the"
" same Cairo path onto a transparent layer, and preview is generated from its"
" straight RGBA data. SVG and PNG share dimensions, margins, and baseline."

msgid ""
"解析前检查 UTF-8、64 KiB 源码与 128 层嵌套限制；输出前检查 16384 单边和 16777216 "
"总像素限制。未知命令、环境、宏定义、文件访问或字体缺字均返回错误和源码字节范围。"
msgstr ""
"Before parsing, UTF-8, the 64 KiB source limit, and the 128-level nesting "
"limit are checked. Before output, limits of 16384 pixels per side and "
"16777216 pixels total are checked. Unknown commands/environments, macro "
"definitions, file access, and missing font glyphs return errors with source "
"byte ranges."
